  "working": "Identify products:\n(i) ZnSO4 + Na2CO3 → ZnCO3 precipitate; calcination → ZnO (white solid, diamagnetic).\n(ii) (NH4)2Cr2O7 on heating → Cr2O3 (or Cr2O3 + N2 + H2O); Cr2O3 contains Cr3+ (d3) → paramagnetic.\n(iii) Cr3+ with excess NaOH → Cr(OH)3 precipitate; Cr3+ (d3) → paramagnetic.\n(iv) HCOOH with conc H2SO4 dehydration → CO2 (or possibly formic acid derivatives); CO2 diamagnetic.\nThus paramagnetic products in reactions (ii) and (iii). Total number of reactions where indicated product is paramagnetic = 2.",
